# ==============================================================================
# Gesture Volume & Brightness Controller - Git Ignore Rules
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Virtual Environments & Local Packages
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Build & Distribution Artifacts (PyInstaller, etc.)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.manifest
*.spec.bak

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Python Bytecode & Runtime Caches
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Editor & IDE Settings
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Operating System Generated Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT PROJECT FILES (Explicitly Preserved / Tracked)
# ==============================================================================
# The following core files constitute the main codebase, configurations,
# specifications, and packaging pipelines:
#
# - gesture_control.py   : Main application, camera loop, detector, OSD, tray
# - gesture_config.json  : Configuration schema and calibrated pinch parameters
# - requirements.txt     : Project dependencies
# - PRD.md               : Product Requirements Document
# - SRS.md               : Software Requirements Specification
# - build_windows.ps1    : Windows PyInstaller build script
# - build_macos.sh       : macOS PyInstaller build script
# - GestureControls.spec : PyInstaller packaging spec
# - .gitignore           : Git repository ignore rules
# ==============================================================================
!gesture_control.py
!gesture_config.json
!requirements.txt
!PRD.md
!SRS.md
!build_windows.ps1
!build_macos.sh
!GestureControls.spec
!.gitignore
